Z||000018||rogergarrison||11-28-2001||06:35 AM||||You need a sand bag in the front to keep the steering working. Remote locks are cool because you wont have to thaw them to get in. buy a piece of cheap vinyl to cover windshield, put some straps on the ends to put in the edges of door windows to hold it. you wont have to scrape windshield.<P>(Or you could have Brit sit on hood all nite to keep it melted  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">...)<P>------------------<BR>           <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/rogergarrison1.gif"> ||||reg||1
